OL,3,GNEWSAPlay tackling domestic abuse to be
OL,4,Aperformed in US
OL,5,
OL,6,FA theatre production that educates
OL,7,Fyoung people on how to spot the signs
OL,8,Fof domestic abuse is crossing the pond
OL,9,Fto run workshops in the United States.
OL,11,FBradford-based social enterprise
OL,12,FSoundproof Box has partnered with the
OL,13,FMegan Montgomery Foundation and the
OL,14,FUniversity of Alabama to bring the play
OL,15,FRed Flags Interactive to stateside
OL,16,Faudiences.
OL,18,FFounder Lise Kaye-Bell, from Leeds,
OL,19,Fsaid the collaboration demonstrated the
OL,20,Flevel of demand for early intervention
OL,21,Feducation around domestic abuse.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
