OL,3,GNEWSAPlay tackling domestic abuse to be
OL,4,Aperformed in US
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is a worldwide problem - it does
OL,7,Fnot start and end in Leeds. We're doing
OL,8,Fa lot of great work and we'll continue
OL,9,Fto do that across West Yorkshire and
OL,10,Fbeyond," she said.
